<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Multi-Agent Social Systems vs Single-Task Agentic Systems</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A1.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Appendix A Multi-Agent Social Systems vs Single-Task Agentic Systems ‣ Social Theory Should Be a Structural Prior for Agentic AI: A Formal Framework for Multi-Agent Social Systems" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 2</span></a> tabulates the differences between Multi-Agent Social Systems and current Single-Task Agentic Systems along the four structural properties.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T2" class="ltx_table">
